1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Morning! Did you sleep well?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,250
Not really. I heard a gunshot
outside the house last night.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
That joke absolutely killed at the party.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
She has a real skill for painting.

5
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,500
They found him dead in the alley.

6
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
There was blood everywhere.

7
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,000
He was drunk again when he got home.
